{
  "id": "poem-fa839dccb46828b1d2448f93",
  "title": "幺",
  "author": "杨景贤",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "你若能尝佛子茶，胜参赵老惮。",
    "休猜做金尊美酒斗十千，但得那世尊肯见。",
    "恰敢着你即时回转，不须妙法再三言。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-3393",
